Everything I do falls apart.

540
00:43:57,865 --> 00:44:00,345
And everyone else ends up suffering
because of me.

541
00:44:02,505 --> 00:44:06,025
Don't overthink it. Rin's safe now.

542
00:44:07,185 --> 00:44:10,345
You're wasted. That's enough.

543
00:44:15,985 --> 00:44:18,865
Yeah, I'm drunk.

544
00:44:21,825 --> 00:44:23,105
Because if I weren't,

545
00:44:24,745 --> 00:44:26,625
I'd have to face the sober truth

546
00:44:27,505 --> 00:44:29,185
that I'm completely worthless.

547
00:44:33,145 --> 00:44:34,625
Just as Dad said.

548
00:44:35,985 --> 00:44:37,425
I can't do anything right.

549
00:44:37,985 --> 00:44:39,465
I can't measure up to anyone!

550
00:44:49,985 --> 00:44:51,505
I'm such a good-for-nothing.

551
00:44:53,745 --> 00:44:55,665
I'm worthless, Mochi.

552
00:44:59,345 --> 00:45:01,025
How hard do I have to try?

553
00:45:02,625 --> 00:45:04,585
Nobody wants me.

554
00:45:05,265 --> 00:45:07,505
Nobody wants me!

555
00:45:17,865 --> 00:45:19,105
I do.

556
00:45:20,825 --> 00:45:21,905
I want you.

557
00:45:59,625 --> 00:46:01,305
Why aren't you resting?

558
00:46:04,105 --> 00:46:06,305
How can I sleep
when the person who saved me

559
00:46:06,385 --> 00:46:08,985
refuses to return to the room?

560
00:46:15,905 --> 00:46:17,665
Damn Krit.

561
00:46:17,745 --> 00:46:19,265
He can't keep a promise.

562
00:46:22,145 --> 00:46:25,865
You've been overthinking all this
because I rejected you, haven't you?

563
00:46:29,425 --> 00:46:30,545
No.

564
00:46:31,945 --> 00:46:32,985
I understand.

565
00:46:34,785 --> 00:46:35,905
I think

566
00:46:37,345 --> 00:46:39,145
it really was too soon.

567
00:46:40,545 --> 00:46:42,905
I should've been
more considerate of your feelings.

568
00:46:55,305 --> 00:46:56,425
I'm sorry.

569
00:46:59,265 --> 00:47:00,665
I really am.

570
00:47:07,065 --> 00:47:09,945
Stop looking like an abandoned puppy.

571
00:47:19,705 --> 00:47:21,465
Do you even know me well enough

572
00:47:22,865 --> 00:47:24,425
to ask me out?

573
00:47:28,425 --> 00:47:29,785
Not yet.

574
00:47:31,665 --> 00:47:33,745
That's why I asked.

575
00:47:35,025 --> 00:47:36,865
So I can get to know you better.

576
00:47:51,745 --> 00:47:54,545
But you know I just got my heart broken.

577
00:47:56,745 --> 00:47:58,825
I'm afraid I might confuse your feelings.

578
00:48:13,825 --> 00:48:15,025
Also…

579
00:48:18,665 --> 00:48:20,785
if you get to know the other sides of me,

580
00:48:23,265 --> 00:48:25,385
you might end up hating me.

581
00:48:37,825 --> 00:48:41,385
I don't know what will happen
in the future.

582
00:48:43,745 --> 00:48:45,185
All I know is that

583
00:48:46,745 --> 00:48:49,665
when I'm near you,
my heart races like crazy.

584
00:48:53,305 --> 00:48:54,865
Does yours race too?

585
00:49:01,465 --> 00:49:02,785
Well, you're handsome.

586
00:49:03,865 --> 00:49:05,305
Anyone's heart would race around you.

587
00:49:05,385 --> 00:49:06,945
That's not what I mean.

588
00:49:07,985 --> 00:49:09,665
Tell me how you really feel.

589
00:49:15,465 --> 00:49:16,625
I don't know.

590
00:49:28,945 --> 00:49:30,505
But I want to find out too.

591
00:49:42,305 --> 00:49:44,065
Do you remember

592
00:49:44,865 --> 00:49:46,905
the legend of the tree
that proves true love?

593
00:49:49,425 --> 00:49:50,785
They say that…

594
00:49:53,305 --> 00:49:55,825
if a couple kisses under this tree

595
00:49:57,545 --> 00:49:59,105
and they're meant for each other,

596
00:50:00,745 --> 00:50:01,905
they will stay together.

597
00:50:06,345 --> 00:50:07,425
Of course.

598
00:50:08,705 --> 00:50:12,105
Actually, I came to this camp
because I wanted to put it to the test.

599
00:50:12,185 --> 00:50:13,905
Do you want to try kissing me?

600
00:50:17,105 --> 00:50:18,625
Do you want to kiss me?

601
00:50:22,345 --> 00:50:24,025
After the kiss,

602
00:50:25,905 --> 00:50:27,585
we'll wait three seconds.

603
00:50:30,385 --> 00:50:32,225
Whether we feel something

604
00:50:34,265 --> 00:50:35,345
or nothing,

605
00:50:36,145 --> 00:50:37,825
we both have to say it honestly.

606
00:50:37,905 --> 00:50:39,185
No lying.

607
00:50:46,305 --> 00:50:47,185
Let's do it.

608
00:51:22,865 --> 00:51:24,185
I'm going to count now.

609
00:51:26,945 --> 00:51:27,865
Okay.

610
00:51:28,985 --> 00:51:29,905
One.

611
00:51:31,625 --> 00:51:32,585
Two.

612
00:51:34,625 --> 00:51:35,585
Three.

613
00:51:36,225 --> 00:51:38,065
-I felt something.
-I felt something.

614
00:51:52,465 --> 00:51:54,185
Thank you so much.

615
00:51:54,265 --> 00:51:56,905
I'm the one who should thank you.

616
00:52:41,985 --> 00:52:44,465
Last night, I made you
lose your way in the woods.

617
00:52:44,545 --> 00:52:47,465
This time, I'll make you fall for me.

618
00:52:47,545 --> 00:52:50,265
Can I try to win Rin over?
I'll do everything I can for him.

619
00:52:50,345 --> 00:52:53,025
But if I ever make him uncomfortable,
I'll back off.

620
00:52:53,105 --> 00:52:54,265
-No way!
-No way!

621
00:52:54,345 --> 00:52:57,665
What's wrong? You've been avoiding me
since we got back from Rayong.

622
00:52:57,745 --> 00:52:58,785
What else do you want, Krit?

623
00:52:58,865 --> 00:53:01,585
I'm already pretending
to date you to fool Rin.

624
00:53:01,665 --> 00:53:03,665
Khobfa, I have a secret.

625
00:53:03,745 --> 00:53:06,905
If you find out, you might hate me.

626
00:53:06,985 --> 00:53:10,705
I promise I'll hold you tight
and never let you go.

